    <data key="d4">pubmed:22155782 pubmed:27758864</data><data key="d5">in vitro (transfected cells and human lung epithelial cells) + animal instillation + human genetics</data><data key="d6">The insoluble surface of a particle binds TRPV1 at residues of the pore-loop region and activates it; coal fly ash is the strongest of the materials tested, ahead of diesel exhaust particles and crystalline silica, while TRPC4, TRPM2, TRPV2, TRPV3 and TRPV4 are not activated and TRPA1 only slightly</data><data key="dev_node">v83be8i5</data></node><node id="wm1pkwvk"><data key="ng">
